<title>USA: Polk Cty, Iowa, won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings.</title>
<headline>Polk Cty, Iowa, won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $10 million of Polk Cty, Iowa, general obligation county purpose bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.6439 percent.</p>
</text>
